          "snippet": {
            "line": 85,
            "text": "theorem fall_by {v v' : ℝ → ℝ} {a b c h m : ℝ}\n    (hv : ContinuousOn v (Icc a b))\n    (hv' : ∀ t ∈ Ico a b, HasDerivWithinAt v (v' t) (Ici t) t)\n    (hm : 0 < m) (hh : v a ≤ h)\n    (hslope : ∀ t ∈ Ico a b, c ≤ v t → v' t ≤ -m) :\n    ∀ t ∈ Icc a b, a + (h - c) / m ≤ t → v t ≤ c := by"
          },
          "declaration": {
            "id": "VoltageToBit.fall_by",
            "kind": "theorem"
          }
        }
